{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0355_rival_01",
      "hash": "4922a821543180a8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「啊！\\n喂～[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0355_rival_02",
      "hash": "4922ab21543185c1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那邊的閘口好像\\n不能通行啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0355_rival_03",
      "hash": "4922aa215431840e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "不過只要穿過[VAR COLOR(0006)]地下通道[VAR COLOR(0000)]\\n就能到達[VAR COLOR(0006)]枯葉市[VAR COLOR(0000)]了！\\c\\n雖說通道裡暗暗的，\\n有點那個……"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0355_rival_04",
      "hash": "4922ad2154318927",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0355_rival_05",
      "hash": "4922ac2154318774",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]，\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳先不要動……"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0355_rival_06",
      "hash": "4922af2154318c8d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我還在想是什麼東西\\n閃閃發亮的。\\c\\n原來是這東西\\n卡在[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的頭髮上啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0355_sys_01",
      "hash": "c60b529203635a3f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]從[VAR TRNAME(0001)]那裡\\n得到了活力碎片！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0355_rival_07",
      "hash": "4922ae2154318ada",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "活力碎片是一種\\n可以讓瀕死的寶可夢\\r\\n恢復活力的道具。\\c\\n我身上也有帶一些……\\n我把我這些也分給[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0355_sys_02",
      "hash": "c60b539203635bf2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]從[VAR TRNAME(0001)]那裡\\n得到了２個活力碎片！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0355_rival_08",
      "hash": "4922a121543174c3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "也許這些能在[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳挑戰\\n下一個道館的時候派上用場喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0355_rival_09",
      "hash": "4922a02154317310",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……咦？[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳拿的那個\\n該不會是船票吧？"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0355_select_01",
      "hash": "2fd0a1f98fff99a0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "１張給你！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0355_select_02",
      "hash": "2fd0a4f98fff9eb9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我剛好多了１張"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0355_rival_14",
      "hash": "491f1f21542e6206",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哇～好好哦～！\\n而且竟然是聖特安努號！？\\c\\n那可是在世界各地巡迴\\n的豪華遊輪啊！\\c\\n就算只有一次也好，\\n我真想去坐坐看啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main0355_player_01",
      "hash": "63a16bd38951be9b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "…………"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main0355_sys_03",
      "hash": "c60b549203635da5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]把１張船票\\n交給了[VAR TRNAME(0001)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main0355_rival_10",
      "hash": "491f2321542e68d2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "咦？真的要給我嗎？\\n我一定要去！\\r\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳怎麼會有這個啊？"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_main0355_rival_11",
      "hash": "491f2421542e6a85",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……什麼！[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳說這是那個\\n會說話的寶可夢給[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的！？"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_main0355_rival_12",
      "hash": "491f2121542e656c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哦，這樣啊。\\n原來他其實是個人類啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_main0355_rival_13",
      "hash": "491f2221542e671f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……拜託[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳忘了\\n那時候的事好嗎。"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_main0355_rival_15",
      "hash": "491f2021542e63b9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好了，\\n那我要繼續前進了！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0355_max",
      "hash": "c5665a8bfdae069c"
    }
  ]
}
